---
const currentDate = new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' });
---

<footer class="w-full border-t border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-50/50 dark:bg-neutral-900/50 py-12">
  <div class="w-full max-w-[1216px] mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8 items-start lg:items-center justify-between">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
        <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">Benchmark sources: Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index, GPQA Diamond, SWE-bench Verified, AIME, MMLU-Pro, LiveCodeBench, MMMU. Data from official model cards, technical reports and Hugging Face.</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">Benchmarks evolve rapidly and the Artificial Analysis index changes methodology over time. Verify original sources for critical decisions.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-4 items-center">
        <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">
          Updated on {currentDate}
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">
          Built by Victor Benazzi
        </p>
        <a href="https://github.com/victorbenazzi/openmodels" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-external group">
          Source code
          <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M2.5 9.5L9.5 2.5M9.5 2.5H6M9.5 2.5V6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
